00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:46,540
people together and let them share their stories. That's how great cultures are built. Celebrate together and commiserate together. And as each and every one of us as people, we can all get agency back into our hands.

31
00:04:46,540 --> 00:04:59,540
So just measure what you treasure. Go ahead and take an assessment like the MHQ that gives you an overall understanding of your wellbeing and guidance on what you can do to enhance it.

